OL,3,AChildren killed while they slept as
OL,4,ARussian missile kills 19 in block of
OL,5,Aflats
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Russian missile has killed 19 people
OL,8,Fincluding five children in an apartment
OL,9,Fblock in northern Ukraine, destroying
OL,10,F30 flats as families slept.
OL,12,FThree of the children were
OL,13,Fone-year-olds in the attack on Pryluky,
OL,14,Feast of Kyiv, early on Wednesday, and
OL,15,Fone of the boys died with his mother
OL,16,Fand grandmother, officials said.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
