OL,3,AChildren killed while they slept as
OL,4,ARussian missile kills 19 in block of
OL,5,Aflats
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine's Volodymyr Zelensky said it
OL,8,Fwas one of Russia's "most vile
OL,9,Fstrikes", and suggested the Russian
OL,10,Fmilitary had carried it out as a
OL,11,F"birthday gift" to Vladimir Putin, who
OL,12,Fturned 74 on Wednesday.
OL,14,FMoscow made no mention of the attack on
OL,15,FPryluky but said its "massive strike"
OL,16,Fhad targeted military industries in
OL,17,FKyiv and elsewhere.
